232 0 obj
  << /ActualText (In fast\055moving strategic moments\054 what matters isn\031t just\240what\031s happening out there\054 it\031s how that landscape gets bent around\240your fork in the road\056\n\nThe\240decision\055anchored\240style forces\240alignment\072 it narrows fuzzy market signals into a judgment scaffolding\056\nThe\240domain\055anchored\240style preserves\240expansion\072 it contextualizes\054 but leaves the framing of the question open\056\n\nThis is a tension between\240action\055ready decision guidance and exploratory strategic immersion\056\n\nThe former is ideal when the decision is already scoped\056 The latter is powerful when the decision is still being\240shaped\056)
     /K [ 3 ]
     /P 233 0 R
     /Pg 226 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
